This directory contains raw `sqlite3 .schema` dumps extracted from the ChEMBL SQLite
databases, produced by EMBL-EBI (https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl/). They are the DDL input to
`scripts/sqlite_to_orm.py`, used to generate the ORM schemas under `chembl_sqlalchemy/`.

These files are not part of the published `chembl_sqlalchemy` Python package; they exist only in
this repository for provenance and reproducibility.

To regenerate a schema module from its vendored DDL:

```
python scripts/sqlite_to_orm.py vendor/chembl_37_schema.sql chembl_sqlalchemy/chembl_37.py 37
```

Source: https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/chembl/ChEMBLdb/releases/

